[{:db/id 17592186133884 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-426ff1c4-32bc-566d-87df-d5bec20e08eb"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-426ff1c4-32bc-566d-87df-d5bec20e08eb" :question/id #uuid "426ff1c4-32bc-566d-87df-d5bec20e08eb" :question/math-academy-id "q-42074" :question/problem "Consider the closed curve $C,$ which is the boundary of the region enclosed by $y=1-{x}^{2}$ and $y=0.$ Express ${∮}_{C}({x}^{2}-y)\\,dx+(2x-{y}^{2})\\,dy$ as a repeated integral." :question/worked-solution "Let $C$ be a positively oriented, piecewise-smooth, simple closed curve in the plane, and let $D$ be the region bounded by $C.$ If $P$ and $Q$ have continuous first partial derivatives on an open region containing $D$, then Green's theorem states that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}P\\,dx+Q\\,dy={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nThe region $D$ and the curve $C$ for this case are shown below.\n\n \n\n![](images/a3/a3fe0bbc283a2eaacffad4b6be071f601781b6b77b2df0dd9b30abb22653c738.png)\n\nWe have that $P(x,y)={x}^{2}-y$ and $Q(x,y)=2x-{y}^{2}.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂P}{∂y}=-1,\\,\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}=2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can express the region $D$ as a type I region as follows:\n\n$$\nD={(x,y):-1\\le x\\le 1,0\\le y\\le 1-{x}^{2}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, applying Green's Theorem, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∮}_{C}({x}^{2}-y)\\,dx+(2x-{y}^{2})\\,dy & ={∬}_{D}(\\frac{∂Q}{∂x}-\\frac{∂P}{∂y})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(2-(-1))\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}3\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-25ac563f-3cb9-5a93-a3a0-eb472a59f7c0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-25ac563f-3cb9-5a93-a3a0-eb472a59f7c0" :answer-field/id #uuid "25ac563f-3cb9-5a93-a3a0-eb472a59f7c0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-1ebea952-0566-5c92-8d0e-e040e7712ee7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ad95bd1a-50e9-550a-940a-b1d62f28413d" "answer-3f01f0a5-e9c8-5d76-9040-7592e7edc559" "answer-c5b67534-974d-530a-a5f5-af0136eb1850" "answer-cfc4f4e1-426a-5f5a-951d-5f244fa030ba" "answer-1ebea952-0566-5c92-8d0e-e040e7712ee7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ad95bd1a-50e9-550a-940a-b1d62f28413d" :answer/id #uuid "ad95bd1a-50e9-550a-940a-b1d62f28413d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-{x}^{2}}(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3f01f0a5-e9c8-5d76-9040-7592e7edc559" :answer/id #uuid "3f01f0a5-e9c8-5d76-9040-7592e7edc559" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}-1}^{1-{x}^{2}}2(x+y)\\,dy\\,dx" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c5b67534-974d-530a-a5f5-af0136eb1850" :answer/id #uuid "c5b67534-974d-530a-a5f5-af0136eb1850" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-{x}^{2}}^{0}\\,dy\\,dx" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cfc4f4e1-426a-5f5a-951d-5f244fa030ba" :answer/id #uuid "cfc4f4e1-426a-5f5a-951d-5f244fa030ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-{x}^{2}}^{{x}^{2}}\\,dy\\,dx" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-1ebea952-0566-5c92-8d0e-e040e7712ee7" :answer/id #uuid "1ebea952-0566-5c92-8d0e-e040e7712ee7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3{\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{1-{x}^{2}}\\,dy\\,dx" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]}]
